&lt;p&gt;Thrive Market’s CRM (Customer Relationship Marketing) team is hiring a CRM Specialist to run campaign operations across email, push, and SMS. You will own execution from brief to deployment and work closely with marketing, creative, product, and analytics partners. This role is a fit for a scrappy, agile self-starter who takes full ownership of their work, communicates proactively, holds a high-quality bar, and turns campaign data into better decisions in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
