&lt;li&gt;Code emails in HTML templates (Sailthru), set up and send push campaigns (Sailthru) and SMS campaigns (Attentive).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain lifecycle and automation workflows, and create and maintain audience lists and segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proof and QA every campaign before launch to ensure flawless execution and member experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to CRM channels A/B testing roadmap: build data-driven test hypotheses, run tests, and turn results into clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze channel and campaign performance, provide actionable learnings, and recommend next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle ad-hoc requests from the CRM team and other departments, and contribute ideas and learnings to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep current on best practices, tools, and industry trends to ensure we are maximizing effectiveness of the channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
