&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 3 years of email marketing and email production experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 3 years of HTML experience in an ESP platform (Sailthru experience preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership and follow-through: you take work from assignment to completion and drive issues and open items to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, reliable communicator: you share status, flag risks or delays early, confirm when work is complete, and partner well across departments.&lt;/li&gt;
