&lt;div&gt;Join us as we bring healthy and sustainable living to millions of Americans in the years to come.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Thrive Market, data is core to how we operate, innovate, and grow. As we continue to scale, we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(Lifecycle Marketing) &lt;/strong&gt;to play a critical role in turning data into strategic insight - guiding decisions for the Lifecycle Marketing team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This role goes beyond building dashboards or pulling reports. Reporting into the Senior Manager, Data Analytics &amp;amp; Engineering, you&#39;ll help translate complex data into clear, actionable insights that shape business outcomes. Whether it&#39;s analyzing member behavior, optimizing campaigns, or supporting cross-functional initiatives, you&#39;ll bring rigor, curiosity, and clarity to every conversation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You’ll be a trusted analytics partner to leaders across Thrive Market, connecting data to real-world outcomes, and helping teams make smarter, faster decisions every day.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot; data-qa=&quot;preview-list-item-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-qa=&quot;preview-list-item-0-text&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact, end-to-end analytics projects that inform key business and product strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with stakeholders to align on priorities and translate questions into analytical frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clear, data-driven insights that influence decision-making across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain dashboards, models, and datasets that empower business teams to self-serve and track performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify data quality issues and help resolve inconsistencies across source systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support lifecycle and engagement analytics to inform retention, LTV, and user journey improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Finance to measure and forecast the financial impact of product and business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to ad hoc analytical requests with accuracy, efficiency, and business context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring thought leadership to Thrive Market’s data practices — recommending new ways to enhance our analytical toolkit and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support the Retention Marketing Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Retention Marketing team to evaluate customer journey touchpoints, measuring the effectiveness of email, SMS, and app engagement campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dashboards and models to monitor lifecycle KPIs (churn, reactivation, engagement rates), identifying opportunities to improve retention and loyalty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver insights that inform personalization strategies and CRM segmentation, enabling more relevant, data-driven communications that enhance customer lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
