&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THRIVE MARKET&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Thrive Market was founded in 2014 with a mission to make healthy and sustainable living easy and affordable for everyone. As an online, membership-based market, we deliver the highest quality healthy, and sustainable products at member-only prices, while matching every paid membership with a free one for someone in need. Every day, we leverage innovative technology and member-first thinking to help our over 1,600,000+ members find better products, support better brands, and build a better world in the process. We are also a Certified B Corporation, a Public Benefit Corporation, and a Climate Neutral Certified company.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join us as we bring healthy and sustainable living to millions of Americans in the years to come.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;jd-section-the-role&quot; class=&quot;jd-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;muted jd-prose&quot;&gt;As a Senior Product Manager on our Product Management team, you&#39;ll own a consumer-facing part of the Thrive Market experience end to end, the moments where members most want clarity and confidence in their shopping journey. You&#39;ll set the roadmap, run the experimentation program, and drive measurable outcomes for your product area, working daily with a core team that includes a product designer, an analytics partner, an engineering manager, and a group of engineers. Because member experience gets attention from across the company, your decisions will be visible well beyond your immediate team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;jd-section-responsibilities&quot; class=&quot;jd-block&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Set the roadmap and strategy for your product area, identifying the biggest sources of member friction across the shopping journey and turning them into prioritized, measurable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Build and run an experimentation program for this surface: identify opportunities, design A/B tests, analyze results, and compound gains over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Work daily with your core pod, a product designer, analytics partner, engineering manager, and 6 to 10 engineers, to ship product changes quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Present strategy and defend trade-offs to senior leaders, given how closely this part of the member experience is watched across the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Prioritize based on analytics, member insights, and experiment results rather than opinion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;5+ years of product management experience building consumer-facing products, including 2+ years at the senior level owning a high-traffic surface (for example search, browse, checkout, subscription, or personalization) for a recognizable consumer technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;A track record of shipping consumer-facing products used directly by customers, on web or mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Experience running A/B tests and building measurement rigor, able to separate signal from noise and defend conclusions statistically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Ability to bring clarity and member-first thinking to ambiguous, fast-moving environments, including navigating cross-team communication to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Experience partnering closely with engineering and data science or analytics teams to turn experiment results into shipped product changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Comfortable working hands-on with product analytics and experimentation tooling to analyze funnel data and measure impact directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with personalization systems, recommendation engines, or ML-driven product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in health, wellness, grocery, CPG, or mission-driven consumer brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling auto-ship, Subscribe &amp;amp; Save, or recurring order programs&lt;/li&gt;
