&lt;p class=&quot;muted jd-prose&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced and forward-thinking Senior Product Manager to lead the development and enhancement of our enterprise accounting/finance systems. In this role, you will play a critical role in driving the strategic direction of our financial systems, with a focus on supporting the unique needs of our e-commerce online grocery business. You will also be responsible for ensuring alignment with our supply chain and e-commerce systems and processes to optimize efficiency and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;
