&lt;div id=&quot;jd-section-the-role&quot; class=&quot;jd-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Senior UX Copywriter to own product and UX copy across the entire member experience. You’ll sit side by side with product designers and move across product areas (e.g., onboarding, shopping, checkout, membership, account) rather than owning a single lane. You’ll write the words members see at every step. You’ll also set the copy standards that keep the experience consistent, clear, and unmistakably Thrive Market! This reports into the Senior Manager of Product Design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
