&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THRIVE MARKET&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Thrive Market was founded in 2014 with a mission to make healthy and sustainable living easy and affordable for everyone. As an online, membership-based market, we deliver the highest quality healthy, and sustainable products at member-only prices, while matching every paid membership with a free one for someone in need. Every day, we leverage innovative technology and member-first thinking to help our over 1,700,000+ members find better products, support better brands, and build a better world in the process. We are also a Certified B Corporation, a Public Benefit Corporation, and a Climate Neutral Certified company.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join us as we bring healthy and sustainable living to millions of Americans in the years to come.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;jd-section-the-role&quot; class=&quot;jd-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;muted jd-prose&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll join Thrive Market&#39;s Product Design team as a Staff Designer embedded in the Discovery Pod, owning search and browse end to end. You&#39;ll work alongside the existing design team, bringing strategic clarity to each initiative you own rather than just executing what&#39;s in front of you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;jd-section-responsibilities&quot; class=&quot;jd-block&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Own information architecture and taxonomy decisions for search and browse, including category structure, filtering and faceting logic, and sort and ranking behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for search relevance, including zero and low result states.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with data and ML teams on search ranking and personalization signals, translating model behavior into a coherent, explainable member experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end design efforts across key initiatives, from discovery through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product designers, product managers, engineers, data analysts, and data scientists to design intuitive and trustworthy member experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Align with Product Managers and Engineers on goals, constraints, and feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for accessibility and inclusive design across products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Contribute to and evolve the design system, collaborating with the design system owner as needed, to keep it consistent and scalable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Mentor other designers with feedback and guidance that supports the whole team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Design filter and facet UX that scales as catalog size and attribute complexity grow
&lt;div id=&quot;jd-section-qualifications&quot; class=&quot;jd-block&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;6+ years of product design or UX/UI experience, with demonstrated ownership of end-to-end initiatives at a senior to staff level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;A portfolio that demonstrates strong user-centered design, interaction design, and visual design skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Hands-on expertise in Figma and other industry standard design tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Experience applying user research methods and A/B testing to inform data driven design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, including the ability to clearly articulate design rationale to cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;jd-line&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;priority-badge sm&quot;&gt;P5&lt;/span&gt; Background working in e-commerce, subscription-based businesses, or consumer-facing digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
